svg: text on a path (#6332)

<textPath> was run as a plain <tspan>, so its text was drawn at the
origin. Flatten the referenced path to line segments and place each
glyph by its distance along it, rotated to the tangent; startOffset
sets where the text starts and x on a tspan is a distance too.

